%%PageBoundingBox:    0     0  1000  1000
%%BeginPageSetup
N
0 0 M
1000 0 L
1000 1000 L
0 1000 L
cp
clip
1.00 GC
0 1000 1000 1000 1000 0 3 0 0 DPLF
[     1 0 0    -1 0   980] CT
%%EndPageSetup
10 -10 TX
1.00 LW
GS
0 0 TX
2042 2042 150 scaleImg
/DeviceRGB setcolorspace
